:
INPUT - W - The wizard who is casting the spell
        SP - The spell being dispelled
        REALM - The ream of the spell being cast
        PRIMARY - The primary realm of the wizard.
        GROUP - The spellgroup of the spell that determines the type of effects.
        CATEGORY - The displayed category of the spell in the spellbook.
OUTPUT - DR - The multiplier of the dispel resistance (in percentages)
:

DR=100;

IF W<>NeutralPlayerID THEN {

IF (Retort(W,Specialist)) %AND (PRIMARY=REALM) THEN { DR=DR+50; };
IF Retort(W,Runemaster) THEN { DR=DR+150; };
IF (HasGlobal(W,GEDarkestHour)) %AND ((GROUP=SGCityBuff) %OR (GROUP=SGCityCurse))
THEN { DR=DR+100; }
IF HasGLobal(W,GERulerofHeaven) THEN { DR=DR+100; }
IF Banished(W) %AND (GROUP=SGCityCurse) THEN { DR=%I(DR/2); }

IF (EVENTTURN(EvSorceryC)>0) THEN { DR=DR+100; }

: Spell Lock has a cost of 100 but a base resistance of 150. :
IF (SP=SSpellLock) Then { DR=DR+%I(DR/2); }


}
